)F FUNCTION -                                                           01000002
  THE CNVTCAT COMMAND CAUSES ENTRIES IN AN OS CATALOG TO BE CONVERTED   02000002
  TO ENTRIES IN AN EXISTING VS2 MASTER OR USER CATALOG.                 03000002
)X SYNTAX -                                                             04000002
         CNVTCAT  INFILE('DNAME') | INDATASET('ENTRYNAME')              05000002
                  CATALOG('CATNAME/PASSWORD')                           06000003
                  MASTERCATALOG('CATNAME/PASSWORD')                     07000002
                  CVOLEQUATES(('CATNAME'('VOLSER' ...)) ...)            08000002
                  LIST | NOLIST                                         09000002
  REQUIRED - INFILE('DNAME') | INDATASET('ENTRYNAME')                   10000002
             MASTERCATALOG (IF CVOLEQUATES SPECIFIED)                   10500002
  DEFAULTS - LIST                                                       11000002
  ABBREVIATIONS -                                                       12000002
      NOTE - IN ADDITION TO NORMAL TSO SHORT FORMS, THESE ARE ACCEPTED. 13000002
             INFILE                IFILE                                14000002
             INDATASET             IDS                                  15000002
             MASTERCATALOG         MCAT OR MRCAT                        17000002
             CVOLEQUATES           CVEQU                                18000002
             NOLIST                NLIST                                19000002
)O OPERANDS -                                                           20000002
))INFILE('DNAME')                                                       21000002
           - SPECIFIES THE NAME OF A DD STATEMENT THAT IDENTIFIES THE   22000002
             OS CATALOG THAT IS TO BE CONVERTED.                        23000002
  'DNAME'  - NAME OF THE DD STATEMENT THAT IDENTIFIES THE OS CATALOG    24000003
             THAT IS TO BE CONVERTED.                                   25000002
