           - NAME OF MASTER CATALOG INTO WHICH ANY ALIASES FOR          47000002
             USER CATALOGS ARE TO BE PLACED.                            48000002
  'PASSWORD'                                                            49000002
           - PASSWORD OF THE MASTER CATALOG.                            50000002
  REQUIRED - 'CATNAME'                                                  51000002
