           - SPECIFIES THE NAME OF AN EXISTING VSAM CATALOG AND THE     53000002
             VOLUME SERIAL NUMBERS OF ONE OR MORE CVOL'S FOR WHICH      54000002
             CVPE'S ARE TO BE CONVERTED.                                55000002
  'CATNAME'                                                             56000002
           - NAME OF AN EXISTING VSAM CATALOG.                          57000002
  'VOLSER' - THE VOLUME SERIAL NUMBER(S) OF ONE OR MORE CVOL'S FOR      58000002
             WHICH ENTRIES HAVE BEEN OR ARE TO BE CONVERTED.            59000002
))LIST     - SPECIFIES THAT ENTRIES ARE TO BE LISTED AFTER THEY ARE     60000002
             CONVERTED.                                                 61000002
))NOLIST   - SPECIFIES THAT ENTRIES ARE NOT TO BE LISTED AFTER THEY     62000002
             ARE CONVERTED.                                             63000002
